**/.classpath
**/.dockerignore
**/.env
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/azds.yaml
**/bin
**/charts
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/obj
/artifacts/
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
LICENSE
README.md
!**/.gitignore
!.git/HEAD
!.git/config
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/heads/**

# This repo ships a hand-authored Dockerfile/.dockerignore (offline build) — keep tracked
!/Dockerfile
!/.dockerignore

# A repo should track its own README/LICENSE (VS template wrongly ignores them)
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# RTI Connext (상용) — nupkg와 라이선스는 추적하지 않음. 각자 RTI 설치본에서 복사.
# (packages/는 air-gapped offline build를 위해 vendored — 추적 유지)
rti/nupkg/*.nupkg
rti/license/
*.rtipkg
*.run
